=== layout: prompt

# Icebreaker

@prompt

Is a hot dog a sandwich?\
Is ice cream a soup?

@examples

State your name, major, and post-grad plans.

- Pick one and defend your rule: ingredients, shape, temperature, or how it is eaten.
- Examples: "A sandwich needs two slices of bread." "Ice cream becomes soup when it melts!"

